including producers Daniel Lupi and JoAnne Sellar, cinematographer Robert Elswit, editor Leslie Jones, and composer Jonny Greenwood.

17
01:41:19,200 --> 01:41:25,200
Inherent Vice premiered at the New York Film Festival on October 4, 2014, and began a limited
theatrical release in the United States on December 12, 2014, by Warner Bros.

18
